### TC-NEG-AUTH-03 | Back Button Access After Logout

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-NEG-AUTH-03 |
| **AC Reference** | AC1 — No access without active authentication |
| **Scenario** | Member logs out then uses browser back button to return to the Pharmacy Benefit Checker results page |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member has previously completed a drug search. Member then logs out |
