### TC-NEG-PLAN-04 | Unknown / Unrecognized Plan Type

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-NEG-PLAN-04 |
| **AC Reference** | AC8 — Feature must support all plan types |
| **Scenario** | Member's plan type cannot be determined by the system — edge-case or misconfigured account |
