## ⚖️ Area 4: Compliance Display Failures (COMP)

### TC-NEG-COMP-01 | ACA Disclaimer Missing on Tier Result

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-NEG-COMP-01 |
| **AC Reference** | AC4 — ACA disclaimer mandatory on all cost estimate screens |
| **Scenario** | Drug search returns a copay tier result but the ACA disclaimer is absent from the results screen |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in. Drug search returns a Tier 1–4 result with copay indicator |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Log in as a valid member. 2. Search for a drug that returns a Tier 1 result. 3. Inspect results screen — document whether ACA disclaimer is present. 4. Repeat for Tier 2, Tier 3, and Tier 4 results. 5. Record disclaimer presence/absence per tier |
| **Expected Result** | ACA disclaimer present on 100% of results screens showing a copay/tier value. No tier result is served without the disclaimer |
| **Pass Criteria** | Disclaimer absent on even ONE tier result = immediate compliance FAIL. Carelon has prior audit findings on this |
| **Severity** | 🔴 High |

