### TC-NEG-COMP-02 | ACA Disclaimer Truncated or Incorrectly Worded

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-NEG-COMP-02 |
| **AC Reference** | AC4 — Disclaimer must convey that actual costs may vary by deductible and network status |
| **Scenario** | ACA disclaimer appears but is truncated, cut off by UI overflow, or uses non-compliant wording |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in on desktop. Drug search returns a tier result |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Log in as a valid member. 2. Search for a drug returning a tier result. 3. Locate the ACA disclaimer on the results screen. 4. Verify the complete disclaimer text is visible — not cut off. 5. Verify wording includes reference to deductible AND network status variability. 6. Resize browser window to check disclaimer visibility at different widths |
| **Expected Result** | Full disclaimer text is visible at all standard desktop resolutions. Wording is complete and compliant — no truncation |
| **Pass Criteria** | No truncation. Both "deductible" and "network status" referenced in disclaimer text |
| **Severity** | 🔴 High |

