### TC-NEG-API-02 | Formulary API Timeout — Slow Response

| Field | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Test ID** | TC-NEG-API-02 |
| **AC Reference** | AC3, AC6 — Formulary API response dependency |
| **Scenario** | Formulary API responds but takes longer than the configured timeout threshold |
| **Pre-conditions** | Member is logged in. API is configured to respond with a deliberate delay exceeding timeout threshold in test environment |
| **Test Steps** | 1. Simulate API slow response (delay beyond timeout threshold). 2. Log in as a valid member. 3. Search for a known drug. 4. Observe: (a) whether a loading indicator appears, (b) how long before timeout triggers, (c) what message is shown after timeout |
| **Expected Result** | System shows a loading indicator during the wait. After timeout, a clear message is displayed. Member is given an option to retry. No indefinite hang |
| **Pass Criteria** | Loading state visible. Timeout handled gracefully. Retry option available. No system freeze |
| **Severity** | 🔴 High |

